Emissivity: I did minimal emissivity corrections in the shock, just enough to change channels that consistently have an \'93obvious\'94 emissivity dependence (i.e. ch. 4 was consistently low for all shots of a similar pressure range). I did not make any emissivity corrections to release for now. Depending on what is chosen for shock emissivity, I think it makes sense that the release is either the same or higher since it\'92s likely dominated by melt.\
